---
import { referralEmailAddress, referralEmailUrl } from "../lib/site";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Design variation: quiet editorial." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
    <title>V3 Editorial | Modern Faber</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style is:global>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html {
        background: #ffffff;
      }

      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        max-width: 620px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 96px 24px 120px;
        color: #171717;
        background: #ffffff;
        font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        font-size: 17px;
        line-height: 1.85;
      }

      main {
        display: grid;
        gap: 2.2rem;
      }

      h1 {
        font-family: "Instrument Serif", Georgia, serif;
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 4.4rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        font-style: italic;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .kicker {
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.22em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #8a8a8a;
      }

      .letter {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.6rem;
      }

      .letter p::first-letter {
        margin-right: 0.02em;
      }

      .join {
        padding-top: 0.4rem;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        text-underline-offset: 4px;
      }

      a:hover {
        text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
      }

      .join a {
        font-style: italic;
      }

      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        body {
          padding: 64px 20px 88px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <header>
        <p class="kicker">Modern Faber</p>
        <h1>to the fabers</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="letter">
        <p>
          Faber is an old word for a maker &mdash; the smith at the forge, the carpenter at the
          bench, the hand that shapes raw material into something that did not exist before.
          <em>Homo faber</em>: the one who makes. There have never been fewer. Not because
          people stopped wanting to make things, but because talking about making became easier
          than making &mdash; the feed rewards the announcement, not the object, and whole
          rooms fill with people circling the work they say they want to do.
        </p>

        <p>
          Modern Faber is a room for the ones who still make. One rule holds it together: come
          back every week with something real, and say what you changed. There is no audience
          here, no applause &mdash; only other fabers paying attention to the details you
          almost skipped. That attention costs something. It is meant to. Keep the rhythm long
          enough and you are left with a body of work, a sharper eye, and the few people you
          actually want beside you at the bench.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="join">
        <a href={referralEmailUrl}>vouch for a modern faber &rarr;</a><br />
        <span class="kicker">referral only &mdash; {referralEmailAddress}</span>
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
